Subject: Implicit frame top

What this does
  Implicit frame top.

Why we need it
  A light call and return read and wrote `regvm_frames_top`, and the return tested the chunk boundary.

What it adds
  Place a light callee at the caller's `regvm_end_off` and bounds-check `regvm_chunk_end`; `regvm_light_seal` raises the top before any record push.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  No.
